# Names only - never values. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in locally; CI reads the same
# names from the repository's Actions secrets. test/no_secrets_in_tree_test.dart refuses a value here
# and refuses any credential-shaped string anywhere in the tracked tree (pro-companion ADR 005, #39).
#
# The companion's own Supabase project: the API URL and the publishable key the app and CI use.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
#
# The live project's secret key, for the owner's tooling only: scripts/owner.dart reads it when
# --project names the live project (README, "Provisioning a race day"). Never on a phone.
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
#
# Not here: a personal access token (the Management API credential). scripts/migrate_live.dart reads
# SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN from your shell, or SUPPABASE_TOKEN (double P) from the git-ignored
# .env.local (README, "Applying a migration to the live project"). It is never tracked.
